Format and reference attributions
---------------------------------
This toolkit interoperates with the Kiteshield packer file format. The format,
struct layouts, and obfuscation scheme it targets originate from:

  * Kiteshield -- github.com/GunshipPenguin/kiteshield
    Copyright (c) Rhys Rustad-Elliott. MIT License.
    (Format/structure source: common/include/defs.h, loader/entry.S,
     loader/obfuscated_strings.h.)

  * "Kiteshield Packer is being abused by cybercriminals" (2024),
    XLab / QiAnXin Technology.
    (Public reverse-engineering write-up of the on-disk format and the
     runtime_info obfuscation used as a format reference.)

The code in this repository is an independent implementation. These entries
credit the sources of the file-format knowledge it relies on; they do not imply
endorsement by those authors or organizations.
